OL,3,GNEWSAHolidaymakers face airport strike
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union has warned flights from Norwich
OL,7,FAirport would be unable to operate if
OL,8,Fair traffic control workers strike over
OL,9,Fthe upcoming bank holiday weekend.
OL,11,FMembers of the Prospect union have
OL,12,Fvoted to take a day of strike action on
OL,13,FFriday, 28 August, amid an ongoing
OL,14,Fdispute over pay and terms and
OL,15,Fconditions.
