OL,3,GNEWSAHolidaymakers face airport strike
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows industrial action on
OL,7,FTuesday, in which air traffic control
OL,8,Fstaff worked strictly to contract hours
OL,9,Fand refused to work overtime, swap
OL,10,Fshifts or work on a goodwill basis. The
OL,11,Fnext strike will see staff take similar
OL,12,Faction on one of the busiest days of
OL,13,Fthe year for travel.
OL,15,FThe airport said it was "disappointed"
OL,16,Fby the move.
